{
  "slug": "adobe-for-creativity",
  "name": "Adobe For Creativity",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Harness Adobe's creative AI-powered tools to edit images, automate design workflows, and bring creative visions to life — from background removal to vectorization and professional retouching.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **8 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (8): `adobe` (Show an onboarding tour of the Adobe for creativity connector: what capabilities are available, an example workflow for…), `adobe-batch-edit-photos` (Apply consistent photo adjustments across a set of images so they look like they were edited together), `adobe-create-pdfs-from-data` (Perform a full InDesign data merge from a CSV/TSV and an .indd template (or a PDF that gets…), `adobe-create-social-variations` (Resize, crop, or export any image or video into platform-ready social media assets using Adobe Creative Cloud tools), `adobe-design-from-template` (Create any visual design using Adobe Express templates — flyers, posters, social media posts (Instagram, Facebook, LinkedIn), business…), `adobe-edit-quick-cut` (Create a punchy sizzle reel from a video using Adobe Quick Cut), `adobe-resize-photos-and-videos` (Resize photos and videos to exact pixel dimensions or aspect ratios using Adobe tools), `adobe-retouch-portraits` (Bulk-retouch a folder of portrait photos using Adobe tools — designed for wedding photographers and event photographers who…)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `Adobe for creativity`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install adobe-for-creativity@claude-plugins-official` from `adobe/skills` (`plugins/creative-cloud/adobe-for-creativity`).",
  "compatibility": [
